 to concentrate on the 3,000 at the Olympics, though that would turn out be ill-fated. The favorites role fell to Romania’s " [:a {:href "/athletes/75145"} "Maricica Puică"] ", with her teammate " [:a {:href "/athletes/75097"} "Doina Melinte"] ", expected to challenge her, and earlier in Los Angeles she had won the 800. The first two laps were led by Britain’s " [:a {:href "/athletes/68615"} "Christina Boxer"] ", but with 600 metres left, Italy’s " [:a {:href "/athletes/71760"} "Gabriella Dorio"] " took the lead, pulling Melinte with her. Melinte took the lead on the final backstretch, but Dorio passed her on the homestretch to win the gold."] "\n"] [:table {:class "table table-striped"} [:thead {} [:tr {} [:th {} "Pos"] [:th {} "Number"] [:th {} "Competitor"] [:th {} "NOC"] [:th {} "R1"] [:th {} "Final"] [:th {}] [:th {}] [:th {}]]] [:tbody {} [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {} "1"] [:td {:class "bib"} "226"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/athletes/71760"} "Gabriella Dorio"]] [:td {} [:a {:href "/countries/ITA"} [:img {:style "padding-right: 2px; vertical-align: middle", :src "https://olympedia-flags.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/ITA.png"}] "ITA"]] [:td {} "4:04.51 (1 h2)"] [:td {} "4:03.25 (1)"] [:td {} [:span {:class "Gold"} "Gold"]] [:td {}] [:td {}]] [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {} "2"] [:td {:class "bib"} "315"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/athletes/75097"} "Doina Melinte"]] [:td {} [:a {:href "/countries/ROU"} [:img {:style "padding-right: 2px; vertical-align: middle", :src "https://olympedia-flags.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/ROU.png"}] "ROU"]] [:td {} "4:10.48 (=1 h1)"] [:td {} "4:03.76 (2)"] [:td {} [:span {:class "Silver"} "Silver"]] [:td {}] [:td {}]] [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {} "3"] [:td {:class "bib"} "316"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/athletes/75145"} "Maricica Puică"]] [:td {} [:a {:href "/countries/ROU"} [:img {:style "padding-right: 2px; vertical-align: middle", :src "https://olympedia-flags.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/ROU.png"}] "ROU"]] [:td {} "4:05.30 (2